    "pageCountField": "pagination.page_count",
    "pageSizeField": "pagination.page_size",
    "objectCountField": "pagination.object_count",
    "notes": "All paginated endpoints return a pagination envelope with fields: continuation (opaque cursor token), has_more_items (boolean), page_number (integer), page_count (integer), page_size (integer), object_count (total records). To advance: verify has_more_items is true, copy continuation token, reissue the same request with ?continuation=<token>. When all records have been retrieved the continuation token is present but the next call returns an empty list. Error BAD_CONTINUATION_TOKEN (HTTP 400) is returned on invalid tokens. No page_size override documented in the spec."
