  "IncrementalSyncCapability": {
    "supported": true,
    "strategy": "changed_since-query-param",
    "notes": "Two object families support the changed_since query parameter: (1) Attendees — GET /events/{event_id}/attendees/ accepts changed_since (ISO 8601 datetime) to filter attendees changed on or after the specified time, and last_item_seen (used in conjunction with changed_since to page incremental batches without duplication). (2) Orders — GET /organizations/{org_id}/orders/ accepts changed_since (ISO 8601); GET /events/{event_id}/orders/ accepts changed_since AND last_item_seen. No other objects expose a changed_since or equivalent incremental filter in the v3 spec. Events, Venues, Questions, TicketClasses, Discounts, etc. require full re-fetch or content-hash comparison for incremental sync.",
    "watermarkField": "changed",
    "watermarkParam": "changed_since",
    "supportedObjects": [
      "Attendee",
      "Order"
    ]
